      You may NOT use, deploy, run, sell, lease, sublicense, or monetize the
      Software, or any derivative works, in whole or in part, for any commercial
      purpose, paid service, subscription model, ad-supported application, or
      enterprise offering.

   b) NO PUBLIC COMPETING FORKS OR REDISTRIBUTION:
      You may NOT publicly distribute, host, publish, release binaries, deploy
      cloud instances, or package forks, clones, or derivative versions of this
