   c) NO CODE EXTRACTION OR ASSET THEFT:
      You may NOT copy, extract, harvest, or reuse core algorithms, security
      and cryptographic subsystems (including liner-signer), custom audio
      processing logic, lyrics synchronization mechanics, visual shaders, or
