   e) NO ALTERNATIVE BACKENDS:
      Any build, fork, branch, or modified version of the Software, including one
      kept and run privately, must work only with the Official Liner Services.
      You may NOT modify, configure, or run the Software or any derivative work
      so that it:
        - connects to, depends on, or exchanges Liner account, library, playback,
          lyrics, or other application data with any server, API, proxy, or
          service other than the Official Liner Services;
        - works without the Official Liner Services, or with them removed,
          stubbed, emulated, or replaced by your own or a third party's
          implementation;
        - bypasses, disables, or reimplements their authentication, request
          signing, edge keys, rate limits, or other access controls.
